{"3616650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wife", "steam_appid": 3616650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wife is a desktop pet game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, and interacting with different parts of the character by clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click the character to open the settings menu and activate a practical voice Pomodoro timer,let Wife to cheer you on for work and study!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase affection over time to deepen your bond, unlock hidden content, and earn achievements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute, energetic girl desktop pet wife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Model Authors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Planner: @路过的猫窝</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Artist: 路过的猫猫@passer-by21456</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrator：@昊冕_</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wife is a desktop pet game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, and interacting with different parts of the character by clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click the character to open the settings menu and activate a practical voice Pomodoro timer,let Wife to cheer you on for work and study!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase affection over time to deepen your bond, unlock hidden content, and earn achievements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute, energetic girl desktop pet wife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Model Authors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Planner: @路过的猫窝</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Artist: 路过的猫猫@passer-by21456</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrator：@昊冕_</p>", "short_description": "Feeling lonely? Want to find a cute girl to keep you